# Vulnerabilities govulncheck may report without failing the build, one ID per line, with why.
#
# Every entry is a decision with an expiry, not a mute button. Remove the line in the same commit that bumps the
# module to the fixed version; scripts/vulncheck.sh prints allowed findings on every run so they stay visible.

# GO-2026-6443: grpc-go server panics on a request with no :authority or Host header. Fixed only in a
# v1.85.0 development build so far (as of 2026-10-01). grpc-concepts reaches it through grpctest.Start, the
# test harness's server on bufconn or 127.0.0.1, so nothing outside the test process can send it a request.
# Pinning a pre-release grpc into a learning repo is worse than this. Remove when Dependabot bumps to v1.85.0.
